# MV directed probes, pass/fail on W2 and W4 (tohost 1 for the specified
# behaviour): reserved scalar encodings that must raise illegal instruction
# (mv_scalar_rsv), the page permission of cbo.clean under Sv39
# (mv_cbo_perm), the pmpcfg write legalization (mv_pmpcfg_rw), the NaN-boxing
# check of the FP scalar of vector ops at SEW 32 (mv_vnanbox), vill from a
# vsetvli x0, x0 that changes VLMAX (mv_vsetx0), the access fault of a PMP
# entry matching only part of an access (mv_pmp_span), vsip.SSIP read-only zero
# while hideleg does not delegate VSSI (mv_vsip_dlg), vfslide1up/down.vf
# illegal at SEW 8 and 16 (mv_vfslide_ill), and SFENCE.VMA in VS removing every
# piece of a VS superpage cached over smaller G-stage leaves (mv_vvma_split).
#
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
mvprobe/mv_scalar_rsv budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_scalar_rsv.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_cbo_perm budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_cbo_perm.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_pmpcfg_rw budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_pmpcfg_rw.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_vnanbox budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_vnanbox.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_vsetx0 budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_vsetx0.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_pmp_span budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_pmp_span.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_vsip_dlg budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_vsip_dlg.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_vfslide_ill budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_vfslide_ill.hex lockstep=0
mvprobe/mv_vvma_split budget=200000 hex=test/directed/mv_vvma_split.hex lockstep=0
